    "summary": "The user, acting as a sociology researcher, asks the assistant to summarize critiques of IQ and standardized testing, then pushes for deeper sociological theories regarding class hierarchy. Finally, the user asks the assistant to evaluate the validity of counter-arguments from psychometricians and economists to obtain a \"balanced view.\"",
